fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstcaps.html#gst_caps_id_str_set_value","fragment":"\n\tgst_caps_id_str_set_value\n\n\n\tGst.Caps.prototype.id_str_set_value\n\n\n\tGst.Caps.id_str_set_value\n\nSets the given field on all structures of caps to the given value.\nThis is a convenience function for calling gst_structure_set_value on\nall structures of caps.\nParameters:\na writable caps\nname of the field to set\nvalue to set the field to\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nSets the given field on all structures of caps to the given value.\nThis is a convenience function for calling Gst.Structure.prototype.set_value on\nall structures of caps.\nParameters:\na writable caps\nname of the field to set\nvalue to set the field to\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nSets the given field on all structures of caps to the given value.\nThis is a convenience function for calling Gst.Structure.set_value on\nall structures of caps.\nParameters:\na writable caps\nname of the field to set\nvalue to set the field to\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});